*All* elven armour may be safely enchanted while it is still at +5 or
less. This includes mithril, shields, etc. Note that this makes elven
mithril better than dwarven mithril, in the long run. +7 elven is one
point better than +5 dwarven.

Alternatively, you could use your penultimate wish for a helmet of
telepathy or brilliance, but note that these can only be enchanted to
+5, not +7. I like elven helmets myself, as well.

